   <taskbody>
      <steps>
         <step>
            <cmd> Click on the arrow beneath the Actions button and select <b>Check-Out</b>. </cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>In the Action Name field, type a descriptive name for the action.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>From Object, select an object and click Save. The list of objects will include any object marked as Individual in Objects.</cmd>
